== Trivia ==
* This item is a reference to the Ladder in The Legend of Zelda for the NES.
* This item is used in {{chal|I RULE!}}.
* This item can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.

== Bug ==
{{bug|In co-op, fellow players can stand on the ladder. If they do this and the player holding the item walks to another ledge, the ladder beneath player 2 will disappear, allowing him to walk on air.}}
{{bug|dlc=r|The placed Ladder can trigger {{i|Ipecac}} + lasers explosions.}}

